# A battle that stops the turn, answered Strategic (docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts"). With
# seed 23, ten systems and seven empires, after the computer has played every empire for 40
# turns, the player's first End Turn stops in a computer's turn: its ship comes through a
# warp point into a sector where the player's forces are. The notice comes first; Strategic
# Combat then asks Tactical or Strategic, and Strategic fights the battle by the strategies.
# The game stays as it was until Close lets the turn go on, and the turn then ends exactly
# once; a second End Turn ends the next one. Play it with the asan preset's client too:
# v0.8.1 crashed here, the main window drawing from vehicles the stopped turn had freed.
# layouts: both (also plays at 800x600: run_input_tests.py --small)
options --quick-start --seed=23 --systems=10 --empires=7 --turns=40 --open=none --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800

wait-screen game
assert-turn 40
# New colonies ask for their type first (questions are modal).
repeat 10
  click item:"*(suggested)" optional timeout=5
end
click tag:button:end-turn
click item:Yes in="End Turn" optional
# The notice: a computer player's turn brought the battle.
wait-for item:Begin
assert-turn 40
click item:Begin
wait-window strategic-combat
assert-present item:Tactical in=strategic-combat
assert-turn 40
screenshot battle-question.png
click item:Strategic in=strategic-combat
# The strategies fight it; Close lights at its end. End Turn does nothing meanwhile (the
# main window takes no input while a window is open) and leaves the window as it is.
wait 300
assert-enabled item:Close in=strategic-combat
click tag:button:end-turn
wait 5
assert-turn 40
assert-enabled item:Close in=strategic-combat
click item:Close in=strategic-combat
wait-closed strategic-combat
wait-turn 41
# Nothing more is played on its own.
wait 120
assert-turn 41
assert-no-window strategic-combat
# The next End Turn plays the next turn (any battle it brings answered Strategic too).
key Escape
click tag:button:end-turn
click item:Yes in="End Turn" optional
repeat 20 until { turn = 42 }
  click item:Begin optional timeout=30
  click item:Strategic in=strategic-combat optional timeout=30
  click item:Close in=strategic-combat optional timeout=600
end
wait 60
assert-turn 42
